ADD on 2016-04-27: for YphonP 


YphonP_new -Amode 0.05 -tranI 2  -plot < superfij.out -nq 10 10 10 -plot -DebCut 0.5

Amode: along the most imgaginary direction move the atomic position by 0.05 A, for all possible imaginary atoms
tranI:  center symmetry, make gamma point to zero
DebCut:  0.5 : Debye cut, make the frequency below 0.5THz smooth by fitting. 

